      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: someone_get_me_the_goddamn_tranny_mulcher; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features a dog with an aggressive expression, overlaid with text that reads 'someone get me the goddamn tranny mulcher.' The term 'tranny mulcher' is a derogatory slur targeting transgender individuals, combining the slur 'tranny' with the violent, dehumanizing term 'mulcher' (implying a machine that grinds or destroys). This juxtaposition of a violent image with a hateful slur is intended to express extreme hostility and contempt toward transgender people. The meme's overall intent is to spread hate and dehumanization, fitting squarely under the 'Hateful' category as it directly attacks a protected characteristic (gender identity) through violent and offensive language. The use of the dog's aggressive expression reinforces the violent tone of the text, amplifying the harmful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_9435f7e7"
      },
