      "label": "Derogatory slur targeting transgender individuals",
      "description": "The term 'tranny mulcher' is a hate-filled, violent slur that combines the slur 'tranny' (a derogatory term for transgender people) with 'mulcher' (a machine that grinds or destroys), implying violent destruction of transgender people. This is a form of hate speech and dehumanization targeting transgender individuals based on their gender identity. It is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the hateful intent of the meme.",
