      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The aggressive dog is mapped as the 'tranny mulcher' entity",
      "description": "The text 'tranny mulcher' is a derogatory slur targeting transgender individuals, and it is juxtaposed with the visual of an aggressive dog. The dog's hostile expression and the human hand restraining it are used to visually represent the violent, dehumanizing concept implied by the slur. The mapping is not literal but symbolic: the dog's aggression is analogically mapped onto the violent intent of the slur, reinforcing the hateful message. The dog becomes a visual stand-in for the 'tranny mulcher' concept, which is not physically present but is the target of the hate speech.",
